"jolpa' DaghoSDI' qa' Sep Da'el pagh Damej. qa' Sep Duj qachmey juSlaH, qa' "
"Sep nIch bach. nIch HoS, jorwI', qa' Sep Duj je neH HoHlaH."

#. TRANSLATORS: what the A flag (Agility) does
